        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:59:47 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://flatline.banast.as</link>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>The first stable release. If you're on 0.2.1, the app is unchanged; this marks it as 1.0.</p>
<ul>
  <li>CPU: total load, user/system split, each Performance and Efficiency cluster, a per-core grid and the load average</li>
  <li>Memory: app, wired, compressed and cached memory with Activity Monitor's definitions, memory pressure and swap</li>
  <li>Network: upload and download from 64-bit counters, session totals and the active interface</li>
  <li>Menu bar shows text, a mini trace or both, at a fixed width so it never shifts</li>
  <li>Readings checked against top, Activity Monitor and netstat</li>
  <li>About 0.1% CPU and 13 MB of memory at idle</li>
  <li>Signed, notarized and updated automatically</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
